= International Relations

It is our task to rebuild our former influence, what organization should we prioritize first?

- @america: Expand our nascent reach towards America, our home country.
- @un: Expand our nascent reach towards the United Nations.
- @eu: Expand our nascent reach towards the European Union.
- @root: The SCP Foundation can stand alone for now
- @easy_discard

@america
on-arrival: america_relation += 1

We decided to approach America.

@un
on-arrival: un_relation += 1

We decided to approach the United Nations.

@eu
on-arrival: eu_relation += 1

We decided to approach the European Union.
